      55.77,
      398.17,
      547.11,
      481.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, the Ministerof Higher Education and Highways, having obtained a report under Section 70 C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of theHorizon College of Business and Technology (Private) Limited, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the CompaniesAct, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration number PV 62877, do by this Order, recognize the Horizon College of Business andTechnology (Private) Limited, as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing Higher Education therein,leading to the award of the Degrees specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, of which the abbreviations are specified inthe corresponding entries respectively in Column II of the Schedule hereto.",
